# Kabaprints Supabase backend — copy to .env (never commit real values)
# 
# Set these in Vercel → Project Settings → Environment Variables as well:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://ccabevypxuwzpbagkiji.supabase.co
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGci...
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJhbGci...
#
# The anon key is public (safe in the browser) — it is restricted by Row Level
# Security. The service role key is server only and must never reach the browser.
#
# Vercel usage:
#   preview  + production both need all three variables.
#   Next.js only bundles NEXT_PUBLIC_* vars into the browser bundle.
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY stays server-side (Route Handlers / Server Actions).
